---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import model from '../data/academic-model.json';
---

<Base
  title="SDA Compass"
  scrollBar
  description="Free Academic Index calculator: the 60-240 recruiting score, worked out with and without your test score. Plus the SDA Compass, which bands it against the class a specific school actually enrolls."
  extraDisclaimer="Named schools use each school's own published Common Data Set figures for the year shown; percentiles within a school are reconstructed from its published 25th/75th and are approximate. Descriptions of other services reflect the methodology those services publish themselves. The Ivy League has never published the Academic Index formula; our calculator uses the standard public reconstruction, and the converted-GPA curve, the test-optional estimate and the band labels are our own judgment calls. It is a planning tool, not an admissions prediction, and a coach pre-read is the only authoritative read on a recruit's academic standing. The calculator excludes the athletic and activities axes and the school-specific banding the paid report is built on."
>

