      <div class="limit-card">
        <div class="limit-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10" stroke="#A5502B" stroke-width="1.6"/><line x1="7.5" y1="20.5" x2="20.5" y2="7.5" stroke="#A5502B" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Not a guarantee</h3>
        <p>We don&rsquo;t guarantee admission, offers, roster spots, or scholarships.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="limit-card">
        <div class="limit-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="9" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M14 7.5 L15.8 14 L14 20.5 L12.2 14 Z" fill="#C9A13B"/></svg></div>
        <h3>A read on fit, not an outcome</h3>
        <p>Built to show competitiveness and fit &mdash; not whether a student will be admitted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
